## Era 5 Architecture

```text
Human Intent
  ↓
SIO (Structured Info Object)
  ↓
CAT (Contract Action Template)
  ↓
Coge (Edge Brain)
  ↓
Brain Master Runtime
  ↓
hacedle GGUF Loader + Inference
```

## Week 1: Bridge & Wire

### Day 1-2: GGUF Bridge
- [x] Delete duplicate brain/master/provider/gguf/* files
- [x] Wire loader.rs to hacedle::GgufLoaderStd
- [x] Add tokenizers crate dependency

### Day 3-4: Tokenizer Bridge
- [ ] Implement BrainTokenizer using tokenizers crate
- [ ] Wire to GGUF tokenizer metadata
- [ ] Test: `hace brain tokenize 'hello'` → real tokens

### Day 5-6: Metadata Real Pass-through
- [ ] Wire BrainGgufLoader::verify() → hacedle loader
- [ ] Test: `hace brain model verify model.gguf` → real metadata

## Week 2: Inference Chain

### Day 7-8: KV Cache
- [ ] Implement KvCache struct real
- [ ] Connect to tensor loading
- [ ] Test prefill

### Day 9-10: Forward Pass
- [ ] Wire BrainKernel.reason() → hacedle inference
- [ ] Test: logits generation
- [ ] `hace brain logits "hello"` → topk scores

### Day 11-12: First Token
- [ ] Greedy sampler argmax(logits)
- [ ] Test: `hace brain prompt "hello"` → "hello world"

## Week 3: Validation

### Day 13-14: Replay Integration
- [ ] Wire replay.rs to BrainSession
- [ ] Test replay save/load/run

### Day 15-16: Multi-model Test
- [ ] Qwen2.5-0.5B verify & inference
- [ ] Phi-3-mini verify & inference
- [ ] Llama-nano verify & inference

## Definition of Done

```yaml
alpha_3_complete_when:
  - GGUF loader wires to hacedle real
  - Tokenizer produces real tokens
  - KV cache supports prefill
  - Forward pass produces logits
  - First token generated from real model
  - Replay system functional
```

